{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2144","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Non-Descending Arrays"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two integer arrays $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ both of length $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can choose any subset of indices and swap the elements at those positions (i. e. make a swap($$$a_i$$$, $$$b_i$$$) for each $$$i$$$ in the subset). A subset of indices is considered "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if, after the swapping, both arrays are sorted in non-descending order."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the number of good subsets. Since the answer can be large, print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 500$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 100$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 1000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$b_1, b_2, \\dots, b_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le b_i \\le 1000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additional constraint on the input: there is at least one good subset."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print a single integer — the number of good subsets, taken modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n2 1 4\n1 3 2\n1\n4\n4\n5\n2 3 3 4 4\n1 1 3 5 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\n8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, there are $$$2$$$ good subsets: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1, 3}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{2}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are $$$2$$$ good subsets: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, there are $$$8$$$ good subsets: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1, 2, 3, 4, 5}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1, 2, 3}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1, 2, 4, 5}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{1, 2}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{3, 4, 5}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{3}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{4, 5}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{}"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"2144C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2144/problem/C"}